taodao/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1737183866534965253%2FQSMgHQHO.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54b1da134d78ff4490357eab81aa4c31", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1737183866534965253%2FQSMgHQHO.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54b1da134d78ff4490357eab81aa4c31, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1737183866534965253%2FQSMgHQHO.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3b7f7475cd55b4999b1161f6ca06cf1 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1737183866534965253%2FQSMgHQHO.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b91607f677ff35ab05f9daebed1dd44 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "タオくんに是非コチラのセリフを言ってもらいたい。\n「お正月も師走(しわす)ってそうなおはこんぶさんへ贈ります」\n「まだ休んじゃ駄目ですよ♪」\n一行目は誠実そうに、二行目は楽しむような感じでお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@1taodao/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1737183866534965253%2FQSMgHQHO.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54b1da134d78ff4490357eab81aa4c31", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1737183866534965253%2FQSMgHQHO.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54b1da134d78ff4490357eab81aa4c31, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1737183866534965253%2FQSMgHQHO.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3b7f7475cd55b4999b1161f6ca06cf1 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1737183866534965253%2FQSMgHQHO.jpg?bg=%23fff&au